  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3139,
      "text": "what would avail them the life of ease that they were given?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 207,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3140,
      "text": "We never destroyed any town without sending them warners,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 208,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3141,
      "text": "to admonish them, for We are never unjust.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 209,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3142,
      "text": "This [Qur’an] is not sent down by the devils[26],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 210,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3143,
      "text": "it is not for them to do this, nor is it within their capability,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 211,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3144,
      "text": "for they are strictly barred from overhearing it[27].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 212,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3145,
      "text": "So do not call upon any other god besides Allah, lest you become of those who will be punished.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 213,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3146,
      "text": "And warn [starting with] the nearest kinsfolk,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 214,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3147,
      "text": "and lower your wing [in kindness] to the believers who follow you.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 215,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3148,
      "text": "But if they disobey you, say, “I disown what you do.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 216,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3149,
      "text": "And put your trust in the All-Mighty, the Most Merciful,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 217,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3150,
      "text": "Who sees you when you stand up [for prayer],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 218,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3151,
      "text": "and your movements among those who prostrate.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 219,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3152,
      "text": "Indeed, He is the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 220,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3153,
      "text": "Shall I inform you upon who the devils descend?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 221,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3154,
      "text": "They descend upon every sinful liar,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 222,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3155,
      "text": "who whisper hearsay in the ears, but most of them are liars.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 223,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3156,
      "text": "As for poets, they are followed by the deviants.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 224,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3157,
      "text": "Do you not see that they wander aimlessly in every valley[28],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 225,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3158,
      "text": "and that they say what they do not do?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 226,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 376,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3159,
      "text": "Except those who believe, do righteous deeds, remember Allah much and defend themselves[29] after being wronged. The wrongdoers will come to know what end awaits them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
